XNote
=====

XNote is derived from the Xpad sticky-note application:

  Project: https://launchpad.net/xpad
  Source:  https://git.launchpad.net/xpad
  Baseline commit: 637c7b51f1b09a28553a926f594f626d363c526a

The upstream work includes contributions from Michael Terry, Paul Ivanov,
Dennis Hilmar, OBATA Akio, Arthur Borsboom, Siergiej Riaguzow, translators,
and other contributors recorded in AUTHORS and the public source history.

The XNote application icon is a recolored and metadata-free derivative of the
Xpad vector icon from that public history. XNote-specific changes and artwork
are copyright their respective contributors. Unless a file says otherwise,
the project is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
any later version. The complete license text is in COPYING.

The BinReloc implementation in src/prefix.c and src/prefix.h is distributed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or any later version.
Its license text is in COPYING.LESSER.

The optional backup helper uses golang.org/x/crypto, golang.org/x/sys, and
golang.org/x/term. Those packages are copyright The Go Authors and distributed
under the BSD 3-Clause License. The included vendored copies retain their
LICENSE and PATENTS files and match the checksummed versions identified by
cloud-helper/go.mod and cloud-helper/go.sum, so source and Debian builds do not
need network access.

